---
question: What dates are you running the takeaway?
order: 4
---
Ammi's Kitchen takeaway is fortnightly on Fridays during term times. The takeaways in the New Year will be on:

-   Jan - 16th and 30th
-   Feb - 13th and 27th
-   March - 13th and 27th
-   April - 24th
-   May - 8th and 22nd
-   June - 12th and 26th
-   July - 10th
